<title>BRAZIL: Details of coffees in Brazil gov't auction.</title>
<headline>Details of coffees in Brazil gov't auction.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's government is to auction 200,000 60-kg bags of coffee stocks at 1400 local/1600 GMT Feb 5.</p>
<p>The auction is of the following coffees in bags.</p>
<p>    QTY	CROP	COLOR	LOCATION</p>
<p> 15,000   1986/87   Greenish    Arapongas, Parana</p>
<p> 11,000   1986/87   Yellowish   Arapongas, Parana</p>
<p>  6,900   1982/83   Greenish    Londrina, Parana</p>
<p> 13,100   1983/84   Yellowish   Londrina, Parana</p>
<p>  6,000   1982/83   Yellowish   Maringa, Parana</p>
<p> 13,000   1982/83   Whiteish    Rolandia, Parana</p>
<p>  7,754	 n/a   Mixed	 Alphaville/Barueri, Sao Paulo</p>
<p>    516	 n/a   Yellowish   Lucelia, Sao Paulo</p>
<p> 21,405   1986/87   Yellowish   Garca, Sao Paulo</p>
<p> 10,695   1986/87   Yellowish   Catanduva, Sao Paulo</p>
<p> 11,332   1986/87   Yellowish   Catanduva, Sao Paulo</p>
<p> 23,148   1986/87   Yellowish   Juiz de Fora, Minas Gerais</p>
<p> 10,150   1986/87   Yellowish   Juiz de Fora, Minas Gerais</p>
<p>  7,500   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, Parana</p>
<p> 13,900   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, Parana</p>
<p>  8,200   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, Parana</p>
<p>  9,300   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, Parana</p>
<p> 11,100   1983/84   Yellowish   Nova Esperanca, Parana</p>
<p>--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417</p>
</text>
